{
  "description": "std-workspace-layout — an IDE-style workspace frame: an optional full-width top bar over one dock-layout whose regions are filled by embedded traits. mainTrait fills the centre (required); the far-left rail (an icon activity bar), the resizable left sidebar, the bottom panel, the status strip, the right sidebar and a floating strip centred over the main area are optional, each turned on by its show knob and filled by its trait knob. On a narrow screen the right sidebar and the bottom panel collapse behind top-bar buttons labelled by their label/icon knobs. Use for editors, designers and builders: the consumer composes each region from its own traits and the frame stays the same.",
